data: {"index":0,"delta":{"content":{"text":"**Interpreting the Pattern**\n\nI'm now deeply engrossed with the geometric interpretation and I am aiming for a length of around 150 words. I am also working on drafting the inductive proof, starting with the base case (n=1) and proceeding through the hypothesis and inductive step. My goal is to combine the proof with the geometric visual.\n\n\\n\\n\n\nI've just finished the first draft of the proof and interpretation, and am presently at the stage of refining it and checking the word count to meet the constraints. The word count check will ensure a concise and clear explanation of the proof. The geometric visual will demonstrate the pattern visually.\n\n\n","type":"text"},"type":"thought_summary"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

